<p>Nexova IT Solutions ("Nexova", "we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal data we collect through this website, why, how we protect it, and the rights you have under the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173) and its Implementing Rules and Regulations. Where the EU/UK GDPR applies to you, we honour equivalent rights.</p>

<h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>
<p>Nexova IT Solutions is the personal information controller. For any privacy question or request, contact our data protection contact at <a href="mailto:{{ s.contact_email }}">{{ s.contact_email }}</a> ({{ s.contact_office }}).</p>

<h2>2. What we collect</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Contact form:</b> your name, company, work email, mobile number, the service you are interested in, and your message.</li>
  <li><b>Technical data:</b> your IP address and basic request data are processed by our hosting provider and web server to deliver the site, prevent abuse and keep security logs. Your IP address is also used to rate-limit sign-in attempts to the admin area.</li>
  <li><b>Essential cookies:</b> a security cookie that protects our forms. See the <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not run advertising or behavioural-tracking tools on this site, and we do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

<h2>3. Why we use it (purpose and legal basis)</h2>
<ul>
  <li>To respond to your enquiry, prepare a proposal or arrange a demo. Basis: your consent and steps taken at your request before entering a contract.</li>
  <li>To keep the website secure and prevent spam or abuse. Basis: our legitimate interests.</li>
  <li>To comply with legal obligations. Basis: legal obligation.</li>
</ul>
<p>We use your data only for these purposes. We do not sell your personal data and we do not send marketing email unless you ask for it.</p>

<h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
<p>Only with service providers that help us run the site and handle your enquiry, under confidentiality and data-protection terms:</p>
<ul>
  <li>our cloud hosting provider (stores the site and the enquiry database);</li>
  <li>our email provider (delivers enquiry notifications to our team);</li>
  <li>Google Fonts (the site loads fonts from Google's servers, so your IP address is sent to Google when a page loads).</li>
</ul>
<p>Some providers process data outside the Philippines. We take reasonable steps so that your data stays protected under comparable safeguards. We may also disclose data when required by law or a lawful order.</p>

<h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
<p>Enquiries are kept for up to 24 months after our last contact with you, or longer if you become a client and the law requires us to retain records. Server logs are kept for a short period for security. After that, data is deleted or anonymised.</p>

<h2>6. How we protect it</h2>
<p>We use organisational, physical and technical measures including encrypted connections (HTTPS), restricted access to the admin area with sign-in rate limiting, and access limited to staff who need it. If a breach affecting your data occurs and the law requires it, we will notify you and the National Privacy Commission within the required period.</p>

<h2>7. Your rights</h2>
<p>You may, subject to the law:</p>
<ul>
  <li>be informed about how your data is processed;</li>
  <li>access a copy of your personal data;</li>
  <li>correct inaccurate or outdated data;</li>
  <li>object to processing, or withdraw consent at any time (this does not affect earlier lawful processing);</li>
  <li>request erasure or blocking of your data;</li>
  <li>receive your data in a portable format;</li>
  <li>claim damages for inaccurate, incomplete or unlawfully processed data;</li>
  <li>lodge a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (<a href="https://privacy.gov.ph" rel="noopener" target="_blank">privacy.gov.ph</a>).</li>
</ul>
<p>To use these rights, email <a href="mailto:{{ s.contact_email }}">{{ s.contact_email }}</a>. We may ask you to verify your identity and will reply within a reasonable time.</p>

<h2>8. Third-party links</h2>
<p>Our products and some links lead to other websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices; please read their policies.</p>

<h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
<p>We may update this policy. The "Last updated" date above shows the latest version.</p>
